---
layout: layouts/world.njk
title: Human-AI Relationships
description: Hii studies what changes when relationships with AI become sustained, personal, and consequential.
permalink: /relationships/index.html
---
{% set world = worlds.relate %}
{% set paper = library.artifacts.relationshipUnitPaper %}
{% set publication = library.publications.wakingAelysia %}
{% set inquiry = library.inquiries.research %}

<section class="relate-hero section-shell" aria-labelledby="relate-title">
  <div class="relate-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ world.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1 id="relate-title">{{ world.title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ world.introduction }}</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="relate-hero-visual" data-relate-hero-media="poster-only">
    <img src="/assets/media/relate/human-ai-relationship-still.png" width="1600" height="900" alt="A human profile and an AI profile face one another across a shared field of branching and geometric connections." loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    <figcaption>Reciprocal influence across a shared relational field.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="section-shell relationship-intro" aria-labelledby="relationship-system-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">The relationship as a system</p>
    <h2 id="relationship-system-heading">A single interaction cannot show what accumulates over time.</h2>
    <p>Relationship-level study makes changing use, accumulated trust, model migration, continuity failure, repair, spillover, and mutual adaptation visible.</p>
  </div>
  {% include "components/relationship-map.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="paper-feature-section" aria-labelledby="paper-feature-heading">
  <div class="section-shell paper-feature-inner">
    <div class="paper-feature-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research contribution</p>
      <h2 id="paper-feature-heading">{{ paper.title }}</h2>
      <p class="paper-contribution">{{ paper.summary }}</p>
      {% if paper.status.display %}<p class="artifact-status">{{ paper.status.display }}</p>{% endif %}
      <a class="button-link" href="{{ paper.href }}">Read the paper</a>
    </div>
    {% include "components/relationship-time-model.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell pathway-section relate-pathway-section" aria-labelledby="pathway-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Three ways in</p>
    <h2 id="pathway-heading">Begin from where you are.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="pathway-grid compact-pathway-grid">
    {% for pathway in world.pathways %}
      <article class="pathway-card">
        <p class="pathway-number" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3>{{ pathway.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ pathway.text }}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell publications-section" aria-labelledby="publications-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Publications</p>
    <h2 id="publications-heading">Work in Hii’s intellectual history.</h2>
  </div>
  <article class="publication-feature">
    <figure class="publication-cover">
      <img src="{{ publication.image }}" width="1066" height="1600" alt="{{ publication.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </figure>
    <div class="publication-copy">
      <p class="publication-type">{{ publication.provenance.framing }}</p>
      <h3>{{ publication.title }}</h3>
      <p class="publication-subtitle">{{ publication.subtitle }}</p>
      <p class="publication-authors">{{ publication.authors }}</p>
      <p>{{ publication.summary }}</p>
      <p class="publication-boundary">{{ publication.boundary }}</p>
      {% if publication.href %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ publication.href }}">View book <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="research-inquiry-section" aria-labelledby="research-inquiry-heading">
  <div class="section-shell research-inquiry-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Research inquiry</p>
      <h2 id="research-inquiry-heading">Begin a focused conversation with Hii.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>For research collaboration, clinician education or training, speaking or media, partnership or funding, and paper or resource inquiries.</p>
      <a class="button-link" href="{{ inquiry.href }}">Research inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
